<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42311" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sālentīni</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sall-</span></b> ),
		ōrum, m.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A people of Calabria</i>, <i>on the
				south-eastern extremity of Italy</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 4,
			2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 5, 10, § 75</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 9,
			42</span></i>; <i><span class="en">25,
			1</span></i>.—Also used to designate <i>the
				country of the Salentines</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in Salentinis aut in Bruttiis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Rosc. Am. 46, 133</span></i>
			; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in Salentinis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 3 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Liv. 10, 2</span></i>.—Hence,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sālentīnus</span></b> ,
				a, um, adj., <i>Salentine</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">campi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mel.
					2, 4, 7</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 3, 400</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">litora,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mel.
					2, 4, 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">promontorium,</span>”
				<i>the south-eastern point of Italy</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. 2,
					4, 8</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 23, 26, § 145</span></i>; Sall.
			Fragm. ap. <i><span class="en">Serv. Verg. 1</span></i>. 1.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Neretum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					15, 51</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">olea,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 6, 1</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 24, 1</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cohortes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					8, 575</span></i>
			.</div>
